  {
   "id": 12120,
   "hub_id": null,
   "version": "2.0.0",
   "description": "<h2>2.0.0 - Unified API Release</h2>\n<p><strong>Major Update</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Combined client and server CommonLib into unified framework</li>\n<li>New server-side services for custom items, quests, loot, bots, and more</li>\n<li>Custom item template registration with full client instantiation support</li>\n<li>Updated guid: use <code>com.wtt.commonlib</code> dependency</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Breaking Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Update <code>BepInDependency</code> from <code>com.aaaWTT.ClientCommonLib</code> to <code>com.wtt.commonlib</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>See full documentation on GitHub</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/WelcomeToTarkov/WTT-CommonLib/blob/main/README.md\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://github.com/WelcomeToTarkov/WTT-CommonLib/blob/main/README.md</a></p>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/2310/wtt-commonlib/2.0.0",
   "content_length": 81392,
   "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.1",
   "downloads": 1967,
   "fika_compatibility": "unknown",
   "published_at": "2025-11-02T01:46:00.000000Z",
   "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:47:41.000000Z",
   "updated_at": "2026-07-28T06:13:07.000000Z",
   "dependencies": []
  },
  {
   "id": 12193,
   "hub_id": null,
   "version": "2.0.1",
